{"availability":"available","full":"Bibin-VR/Tovex-ERP","name":"Tovex-ERP","description":"Industrial manufacturing ERP suite — React 19 + WebGL/three.js GLSL shaders, 12-role RBAC, front-end-only demo","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-24T09:11:41Z","updated":"2026-07-30T03:31:35Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://bibinvr.tech/projects/tovex-erp","topics":["erp","manufacturing","react","threejs","typescript","webgl"],"demo":"https://bibin-vr.github.io/Tovex-ERP/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T15:03:39.712Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T15:03:39.712Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T15:03:39.712Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T05:41:15.489Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T06:38:14.293Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-10T15:03:39.712Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Three.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Industrial ERP suite for a steel and heavy-fabrication plant — front-end only.","Every screen works, every role sees a personalised experience, and all data flows from a single in-memory source of truth. The visual layer is built on WebGL — three.js with custom GLSL shaders — for a \"rendered, not drawn\" control-room feel.","No backend and no login. The app boots into a first-run setup wizard (create company → set brand → add or import members) and then straight into the dashboard. Operational data is seeded in memory; company, members, modules, and permission overrides persist locally."],"features":["Live theming. A dark control-room theme with a molten-orange accent as the single source of truth. Change it in Company Settings and the whole app re-themes live — both the CSS variables and the shader's uAccent uniform.","12 roles with RBAC. A header role switcher re-personalises the dashboard, sidebar, calendar focus, and write permissions. The permission matrix is editable under Access Control.","First-run setup wizard. Company profi